Brilliant! A new Nethack abuse (well, maybe not, but I've never heard anyone
mention it before).

Fill the level with werethings (pets). Go up or down to another level and
wait for a while. When you return to the altAr level your pets will no longer
be friendly. They will attack you, and you can kill them without losing any
luck. Then #offer to your hearts content, and gain zillions of named weapons
and pray for other good things.

The only problem is that rats and jackals are no good to #offer. So you will
have to be a werewolf, and hence to kill a large number of wolves you will need
a reasonably strong character. Still, wolves are not as nasty as black puddings.

One other thing. Perhaps it is better not to fill the level too full, since it
gets very difficult to move around through a large number of pets. They tend to
follow you in a huge mass, and you are forever "stopping to avoid hitting your
pet".

